  "fixed_regressions": [
    "Copied workspace did not activate through naming dialog.",
    "Header spacer omission spread the context badge across the header.",
    "Dock preview used old 4px splitter and120x80 minimums while layout used prototype8px/280x140.",
    "Extreme saved split ratio could place a pane outside the available viewport; geometry now clamps without rewriting saved ratio.",
    "Hydration wrote context state back during QML root evaluation; coalesced read-only registration removes reentrant bindings.",
    "Reset Layout discarded all workspace presets and appearance; now resets active layout only.",
    "Successful panel registration/settings edits dismissed an unrecovered restore error; error preservation is centralized until explicit reset."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Owner appearance/interaction and public-interface approval is not granted; #40 remains open.",
    "#59 owns existing graph/viewer/timeline body replacement, compact viewer body/header-tools integration and usable whole-app cutover; #43/#44/#46/#47/#50/#54 retain later feature obligations.",
